Package: logr
Title: Write Printed Output of R Objects to Log Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Jeffzifan", family = "Wu", email = "zifan.jeffwu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides writeLog(), a small helper that writes the printed
    output of a named list of R objects to a text file in a log directory,
    one element after another, each preceded by its list name as a heading.
    Supports versioned file names and appending to an existing log file.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
